ance-plain-text" data-dynamic-column data-faq-item> <div class="flex-row"> <a role="button" class="zpa-accordion__question zp ewa-5880840" data-faq-header> <div class="xs-12 zpa-accordion__question-content"> <div class="zpa-offset-right-sm zp ea-5880841"> What are BOMSocks anyway? </div> <svg width="16px" height="16px" class="zpa-accordion__question-icon zpa-accordion__question-icon--plus"> <use xlink:href="#plusIcon"></use> </svg> <svg width="16px" height="16px" class="zpa-accordion__question-icon zpa-accordion__question-icon--minus"> <use xlink:href="#minusIcon"></use> </svg> </div> </a> </div> <div class="zpa-accordion__answer flex-row"> <div class="zpa-flex--column xs-12" data-dynamic-column> <div class="zpa-word-wrap disable-internal-link zpa-mobile-offset-bottom-sm zpa-tablet-offset-bottom-sm zpa-offset-bottom-sm zp ea-5880843"> <p class="zp ts-regular-1 tsl-1"><span>BOMSocks are the ultimate scripture-themed socks on a mission to spread the gospel in the most playful and fashionable way imaginable. With over 60 different styles to choose from, BOMSocks will transport you to a world of scripture heroes, breathtaking temple landscapes, and even mission destinations. 🧦✨</span></p> </div> </div> </div> </div> <div class="zpa-flex--column xs-12 zpa-accordion__item zpa-accordion__item--appearance-plain-text" data-dynamic-column data-faq-item> <div class="flex-row"> <a role="button" class="zpa-accordion__question zp ewa-5880840" data-faq-header> <div class="xs-12 zpa-accordion__question-content"> <div class="zpa-offset-right-sm zp ea-5880844"> What are they made out of? </div> <svg width="16px" height="16px" class="zpa-accordion__question-icon zpa-accordion__question-icon--plus"> <use xlink:href="#plusIcon"></use> </svg> <svg width="16px" height="16px" class="zpa-accordion__question-icon zpa-accordion__question-icon--minus"> <use xlink:href="#minusIcon"></use> </svg> </div> </a> </div> <div class="zpa-accordion__answer flex-row"> <div class="zpa-flex--column xs-12" data-dynamic-column> <div class="zpa-word-wrap disable-internal-link zpa-mobile-offset-bottom-sm zpa-tablet-offset-bottom-sm zpa-offset-bottom-sm zp ea-5880846"> <p class="zp ts-regular-1 tsl-1"><span>It's not just the heavenly designs that set BOMSocks apart. These socks are meticulously crafted with the perfect blend of rayon, polyester, and a super-soft cotton bottom, creating an unparalleled level of comfort and cushioning. Say goodbye to uncomfortable sock experiences because with BOMSocks, you'll enjoy that delightful new sock feeling wash-after-wash. 🛁🌬️</span></p><p class="zp ts-regular-1 tsl-2"><br></p><p class="zp ts-regular-1 tsl-3"><span>And don't worry about durability! These socks are as durable as HECK! (Excuse our language, but we can't contain our excitement.) BOMSocks will accompany you on your journey well into the Millennium, outlasting those cheap big box brands. We're talking long-lasting comfort that will keep you striding in righteousness for years to come. 🚀🔒</span></p> </div> </div> </div> </div> <div class="zpa-flex--column xs-12 zpa-accordion__item zpa-accordion__item--appearance-plain-text" data-dynamic-column data-faq-item> <div class="flex-row"> <a role="button" class="zpa-accordion__question zp ewa-5880840" data-faq-header> <div class="xs-12 zpa-accordion__question-content"> <div class="zpa-offset-right-sm zp ea-5880847"> Who loves BOMSocks? </div> <svg width="16px" height="16px" class="zpa-accordion__question-icon zpa-accordion__question-icon--plus"> <use xlink:href="#plusIcon"></use> </svg> <svg width="16px" height="16px" class="zpa-accordion__question-icon zpa-accordion__question-icon--minus"> <use xlink:href="#minusIcon"></use> </svg> </div> </a> </div> <div class="zpa-accordion__answer flex-row"> <div class="zpa-flex--column xs-12" data-dynamic-column> <div class="zpa-word-wrap disable-internal-link zpa-mobile-offset-bottom-sm zpa-tablet-offset-bottom-sm zpa-offset-bottom-sm zp ea-5880849"> <p class="zp ts-regular-1 tsl-1"><span>Not only do BOMSocks provide righteous comfort, but they also make the perfect gift for everyone in circle. From dads and moms to grandparents, missionaries, youth, and even your beloved Bishop and his counselors, the possibilities are endless. Spread the love and inspiration with every pair of BOMSocks you give, and watch the smiles light up their faces. 😊🎁</span></p> </div> </div> </div> </div> <div class="zpa-flex--column xs-12 zpa-accordion__item zpa-accordion__item--appearance-plain-text" data-dynamic-column data-faq-item> <div class="flex-row"> <a role="button" class="zpa-accordion__question zp ewa-5880840" data-faq-header> <div class="xs-12 zpa-accordion__question-content"> <div class="zpa-offset-right-sm zp ea-5880850"> Are these divine socks really worth it? </div> <svg width="16px" height="16px" class="zpa-accordion__question-icon zpa-accordion__question-icon--plus"> <use xlink:href="#plusIcon"></use> </svg> <svg width="16px" height="16px" class="zpa-accordion__question-icon zpa-accordion__question-icon--minus"> <use xlink:href="#minusIcon"></use> </svg> </div> </a> </div> <div class="zpa-accordion__answer flex-row"> <div class="zpa-flex--column xs-12" data-dynamic-column> <div class="zpa-word-wrap disable-internal-link zpa-mobile-offset-bottom-sm zpa-tablet-offset-bottom-sm zpa-offset-bottom-sm zp ea-5880852"> <p class="zp ts-regular-1 tsl-1"><span>Absolutely! BOMSocks are built with the same impeccable craftsmanship as those expensive $89 designer pairs sold in high-end department stores, but at a fraction of the cost. We believe that comfort and inspiration should be accessible to all, so you can revel in luxurious comfort without emptying your pockets. 💰💫</span></p> </div> </div> </div> </div> <div class="zpa-flex--column xs-12 zpa-accordion__item zpa-accordion__item--appearance-plain-text" data-dynamic-column data-faq-item> <div class="flex-row"> <a role="button" class="zpa-accordion__question zp ewa-5880840" data-faq-header> <div class="xs-12 zpa-accordion__question-content"> <div class="zpa-offset-right-sm zp ea-5880853"> So what's the catch? Are these really free? </div> <svg width="16px" height="16px" class="zpa-accordion__question-icon zpa-accordion__question-icon--plus"> <use xlink:href="#plusIcon"></use> </svg> <svg width="16px" height="16px" class="zpa-accordion__question-icon zpa-accordion__question-icon--minus"> <use xlink:href="#minusIcon"></use> </svg> </div> </a> </div> <div class="zpa-accordion__answer flex-row"> <div class="zpa-flex--column xs-12" data-dynamic-column> <div class="zpa-word-wrap disable-internal-link zpa-mobile-offset-bottom-sm zpa-tablet-offset-bottom-sm zpa-offset-bottom-sm zp ea-5880855"> <p class="zp ts-regular-1 tsl-1"><span>Yes, your first pair of BOMSocks are free! Just pay $4.95 shipping. </span></p><p class="zp ts-regular-1 tsl-2"><br></p><p class="zp ts-regular-1 tsl-3"><span>The catch is that </span><span class="zp tsl-4">we are so confident</span><span> </span><span class="zp tsl-5">you'll love your free pair</span><span> and will be back for more. We realize it's even worth losing some money now knowing you'll come back again!</span></p><p class="zp ts-regular-1 tsl-6"><br></p><p class="zp ts-regular-1 tsl-7"><span>When holidays and birthdays come around and you are shopping for gifts, you'll think of us before heading over to Deseret Book (no offense, we love Deseret Book, but we love BOMSocks more.)</span></p> </div> </div> </div> </div> <div class="zpa-flex--column xs-12 zpa-accordion__item zpa-accordion__item--appearance-plain-text" data-dynamic-column data-faq-item> <div class="flex-row"> <a role="button" class="zpa-accordion__question zp ewa-5880840" data-faq-header> <div class="xs-12 zpa-accordion__question-content"> <div class="zpa-offset-right-sm zp ea-5880856"> Can missionaries really wear BOMSocks? </div> <svg width="16px" height="16px" class="zpa-accordion__question-icon zpa-accordion__question-icon--plus"> <use xlink:href="#plusIcon"></use> </svg> <svg widt